  "description": "Lee Jae-Ha knows it’s absurd for him to ask for Jang Tae-Geon’s hand in marriage. While Jae-Ha is the heir to Korea’s most prestigious corporation, Tae-Geon is a violent gangster. But above all, both of them are dominant alphas. So when they inevitably do get married, Jae-Ha doesn’t dare to ask for anything more, instead drawing lines in the name of respecting the man he selfishly fell in love with. But these lines only end up aggravating Tae-Geon, who’s actually had his eyes on Jae-Ha just the same...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
